  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "即使不如此握紧，亦颇令人不快。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even without gripping it so tightly, it was still rather unpleasant.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "髭黑大将也看了信，笑道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "General Higekuro also read the letter and said with a laugh:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“女子既到夫家之后，若无特别事由，即使是生身父母，亦不便轻易去访，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Once a woman has gone to her husband's house, unless there is some special reason, it is improper for her to visit even her own parents casually,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "何况太政大臣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "let alone the Grand Minister.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "他为什么对你时刻不忘，并且来信申恨诉怨呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why does he keep thinking of you at every moment, and even send letters pouring out his grievances and resentment?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "他愤愤不平，玉鬘很讨厌他。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was indignant and resentful, and Tamakazura found him very repellent.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "回信也不肯写，对他说道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She would not even write a reply, and said to him:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "“这回信我不能写。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I cannot write this reply.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "髭黑大将答道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "General Higekuro answered:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "“我来写吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will write it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "他作代笔也觉得很恼火。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even acting as her proxy writer made him feel deeply irritated.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03042",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "答诗曰：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The reply poem read:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
